WEBVTT

00:10:29.563 --> 00:10:33.730
I would say this is the most
exciting time for a biotech start-up,

00:10:33.763 --> 00:10:36.797
because you can see that, you know,

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:42.463
a lot of the new ideas are actually coming
out of small biotech start-ups.

00:10:42.463 --> 00:10:48.130
And as you heard, BioNTech
was actually struggling to survive

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:50.130
and suddenly COVID has made them

00:10:50.163 --> 00:10:53.997
into a multibillion-dollar
biotech company today.

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:55.597
So I think, you know,

00:10:55.630 --> 00:11:01.830
we must understand that any idea
can be a blockbuster idea.